From: Armada <no-reply@armadaos.dev>
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno: a7xx gen1 has no early preamble

Shaders with an early preamble make HUD sprites flicker on the a7xx gen1.
IR3_SHADER_DEBUG=noearlypreamble fixes it.

Turn it off for all of a7xx gen1 (A710, A720, A722, A725, A730).
---
diff --git a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
index fe70402..5f3b50d 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
+++ b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
@@ -839,2 +839,4 @@ a7xx_base = GPUProps(
 a7xx_gen1 = GPUProps(
+        # Early preambles make shader output flicker on gen1.
+        has_early_preamble = False,
         supports_uav_ubwc = True,
